WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.260
I was sent to Ryan Army Air Field as a first lieutenant, Medical Administrative Corps.

2
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.920
I went in and had my physical.

3
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.360
I went over to the hospital; every typewriter stopped typing.

4
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:19.160
Every head turned toward me.

5
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.040
A gray-haired colonel walked out.

6
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.420
The captain gave him my papers; he threw them back to me, said, “They must have made a mistake.”

7
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.320
I took my papers and I went home.

8
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.860
Took off my uniform; I felt like burning it.
